$ ./hyperelliptic-cover --help
A bounded, certificate-oriented interface. It constructs the repository's fixed same-field cover families, replays their certificates, runs checked arithmetic where the infinity model is supported, and exports catalog evidence. It is not an index-calculus or key-recovery solver.

Usage: hyperelliptic-cover <COMMAND>

Commands:
  construct       Construct and replay a cover certificate for one exact elliptic model object
  verify          Replay a supplied `{model, certificate}` request
  arithmetic      Run checked arithmetic on supported binary-cover or odd-prime one-infinity Jacobians
  catalog-export  Rebuild the deterministic cover catalog from the exact model registry
  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
$ ./ecdlp-audit --help
Validate ECDLP audit control-plane records

Usage: ecdlp-audit <COMMAND>

Commands:
  verify-plan            Verify the non-authoritative eight-workstream planning record
  verify-fixed-f8-order  Independently replay the exact fixed-GF(8) genus-3 order certificate
  help                   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
